cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Phoenix NPU PQC: Post-Quantum Cryptography Research for AMD Phoenix NPU1"
abstract: "A public research repository for FIPS 202 SHA-3/SHAKE, FIPS 203 ML-KEM, and FIPS 204 ML-DSA work on AMD Ryzen AI Phoenix NPU1 (XDNA1/AIE2). It preserves a historical M32/M33 hybrid foundation, narrow physical DR0/DR1 and DR2a/DR2b/DR2c records, and an unresolved integrated DR2d ML-KEM-512 K-PKE.KeyGen physical result of 0/25. The long-term goal is 100% NPU residency; this repository does not claim that goal is complete."
